      ],
      "text": "The dragon plunges their body into the ground, Burrows up to their burrow Speed, and then scorches the land within a 60-foot emanation. Creatures underground or on the surface in the area take 8d6 fire damage (DC 37 basic Fortitude save save). A creature that critically fails also becomes Enfeebled 1 for 1 minute."
